@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 登录认证时序图

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E4D7B
  ActorBorderColor #2E4D7B
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E4D7B
}

actor "用户" as user
participant "前端UI" as ui
participant "SysLoginController" as controller
participant "SysLoginService" as loginSvc
participant "CaptchaController" as captcha
participant "AuthenticationManager" as authMgr
participant "UserDetailsServiceImpl" as userDetail
participant "TokenService" as tokenSvc
participant "Redis" as redis
participant "数据库" as db

== 1. 获取验证码 ==
user -> ui : 访问登录页面
ui -> captcha : GET /captchaImage
captcha -> redis : 存储验证码(uuid, 结果)
redis --> captcha : OK
captcha --> ui : 返回base64图片+uuid

== 2. 提交登录 ==
user -> ui : 输入用户名/密码/验证码
ui -> controller : POST /login(username, password, code, uuid)
controller -> loginSvc : login()
loginSvc -> redis : 验证验证码
redis --> loginSvc : 验证结果
loginSvc -> authMgr : authenticate(token)
authMgr -> userDetail : loadUserByUsername(username)
userDetail -> db : 查询用户信息
db --> userDetail : SysUser
userDetail --> authMgr : LoginUser(用户+权限)
authMgr --> loginSvc : Authentication
loginSvc -> tokenSvc : createToken(loginUser)
tokenSvc -> redis : 存储LoginUser(UUID)
redis --> tokenSvc : OK
tokenSvc --> loginSvc : JWT token
loginSvc -> db : 更新最后登录IP/时间
loginSvc --> controller : AjaxResult(token)
controller --> ui : 返回token

== 3. 获取用户信息 ==
ui -> controller : GET getInfo(Header: Bearer token)
controller -> tokenSvc : 解析token
tokenSvc -> redis : 获取LoginUser
redis --> tokenSvc : LoginUser
tokenSvc --> controller : LoginUser
controller --> ui : 用户信息+角色+权限

== 4. 获取路由菜单 ==
ui -> controller : GET getRouters
controller -> menuSvc : selectMenuTreeByUserId()
menuSvc -> db : 查询可用菜单
db --> menuSvc : List<SysMenu>
menuSvc --> controller : List<RouterVo>
controller --> ui : 动态路由配置
ui -> user : 渲染首页菜单

@enduml
